# MODtemp

A simple and lightweight Gorilla Tag mod template designed to help developers quickly start creating their own BepInEx plugins.

This template provides a clean and minimal project structure with separate plugin information and main plugin files. It can be used as a starting point for creating and developing Gorilla Tag mods.

## Features

* Simple BepInEx plugin structure
* Separate `PluginInfo.cs`
* Minimal `Plugin.cs`
* Easy to customize
* Designed for beginners and experienced developers
* Ready to be expanded with your own features

## Getting Started

Clone or download the repository, open the project in your preferred C# development environment, and start building your own Gorilla Tag plugin.

MODtemp is intended to be a basic starting point, not a finished mod.
